KORTEX PAST EXAMINATION PAPERS
WAEC - English Language (Year 2024)

Q1. Choose the word OPPOSITE in meaning to the underlined word: The minister made an *arbitrary* ruling.
  (A) hasty
  (B) reasoned
  (C) harsh
  (D) objective
  Answer: B - Arbitrary means based on personal whim; the opposite is reasoned.


